 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 544823,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>The Chionilis family is trying to decide on a restaurant again, but now they don’t want to deal with multiple runoffs or even ranking. They will use the approval voting method shown in the following table. Each family member will approve their top two choices. Rainbow China won when multiple runoffs were used. Find the winner for tonight’s dinner.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><b>Options</b></th>\n<th><b>A</b></th>\n<th><b>R</b></th>\n<th><b>S</b></th>\n<th><b>T</b></th>\n<th><b>G</b></th>\n<th><b>E</b></th>\n<th><b>M</b></th>\n<th><b>D</b></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Rainbow China</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dough Boys Pizza</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Taco City</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Caribbean Flavor</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Count the number of Yes votes earned by each option.</p>\n<p>Rainbow China: 4</p>\n<p>Dough Boys Pizza: 6</p>\n<p>Taco City: 3</p>\n<p>Caribbean Flavor: 3</p>\n<p>The option with the most Yes votes wins.</p>\n<p>Dough Boys Pizza wins with the most points.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Dough Boys Pizza is the winner for dinner."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
